{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1000_p", "source_sha256": "505a1b709afba5f6ce0c7fae4d29d34521b31115017f0e8437b96d9d706f6f81", "ja": "（今日は、ひなたと一緒に\nテレビ局への挨拶回りだ）", "zh": "（今天要和日向一起去电视台挨家挨户打招呼）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "aa54ed09eddd1ff6ce38af46c6c6e3042ca30476e5940dadda193cc7b5dab7f4", "ja": "{$P$}。\n挨拶回りって、どんなことを話したらいいんだろか？", "zh": "{$P$}。\n跑电视台拜访时，该说些什么才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7ca71a1079780033851e24486a41283c9b7e6c2337771fd59011f9a167fdb311", "ja": "難しく考えないで、普通に\n挨拶をすれば大丈夫だと思うよ。", "zh": "别想得太复杂，平常一样\n打个招呼就没问题了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1003_p", "source_sha256": "32cc47302468b114fe51add259453e7bde1e3995f774f72e67beee8e44b49571", "ja": "あとは……ひなたのいいところを\nアピールできれば、それが一番だな！", "zh": "然后……要是能展现出日向的优点，\n那就是最好的了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "b5b9cdefd9b9b77939a9b021d1d4119c1456f6e3a90efcedf7581e054ab82c48", "ja": "ええ？　あたしのいいところをかい？\nそうだねえ……。", "zh": "诶？要宣传我的优点吗？\n是啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "60a483a824071a9aca5038e6c99b8e25e79817e58e971b872535975a998113aa", "ja": "あたしのいいところって、なんだろか……。\n土いじりには、ちょっこし自信あるけども。", "zh": "我的优点……是什么来着……\n虽然我对种地还是有那么点自信的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1006_p", "source_sha256": "1253c22dafe9278e0ff731cc2f2297c69eb84b927d057a876b7918ca032f3e1a", "ja": "土いじりだけじゃないぞ。\nひなたには、他にもいいところがたくさんあるよ。", "zh": "可不只是摆弄花草哦。\n日向还有很多其他优点呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "fb3924b9f2a8e5dbd2d90bbb7ef5321415dd811e2f87f9666a9226859c91bd51", "ja": "そうなのかねぇ？\n自分では、あんましよくわからんのだけども……。", "zh": "是这样的吗？\n我自己倒是不太明白……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9d7ab4f5818aba01d2e659b57117278aff52092fcc3af470d75bbd3b97f1e3ba", "ja": "そうだな、例えば……。", "zh": "是啊，比如说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1009_null", "source_sha256": "fd953d6b10134151f33bf9406c54a5d1e24669b0da546777d8ce935566587e9a", "ja": "ドスン！", "zh": "咚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "6faf8e0301e5731e91c94d833ebceff1cc2a0e16876f8632612d00dec27f55cb", "ja": "わ、わぁ！？", "zh": "哇、哇！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a5402ce1d699c09faf575cf350561caea836d260208b2bd3a51b8fec0e5e1906", "ja": "ひなた！？\n大丈夫か？", "zh": "阳奈！？\n你没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "937fb773aa58f27d4a4d11544f44368558d907833998d9d4a905a5037b55a70f", "ja": "う、うん……あたしは大丈夫だけども……。\nボク、大丈夫かい？", "zh": "嗯、嗯……我倒是没事……\n小朋友，你还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1013_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "cc072faa54e6bef9f0c49ee6e8330e078b35ca7c03de79c26913725c7050b9d0", "ja": "うぅ……ひっく。ぐす、ぐす……。", "zh": "呜……嗝。抽泣、抽泣……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1014_p", "source_sha256": "3ef7eb9553b812018c4f32239e520b49490854b440d2550f0e618577525701e1", "ja": "この子は……番組の出演者かな？\nキミ、大丈夫？　どこから来たの？", "zh": "这孩子是……节目的出演者吗？\n你还好吗？是从哪里来的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1015_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "e38ed886af5912321729b01932adf266e37dc12d0f2b7dec1f7a45fcd5f4dc38", "ja": "ひっく……うぅ、うわぁ～ん……！", "zh": "抽泣……呜呜，哇啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1016_p", "source_sha256": "5f6001112b6b868563a5013b12bc7c1c799cdd3e5796ca6530fbbc980341989c", "ja": "う～ん、泣いちゃって話もできないか……。\n困ったな。", "zh": "嗯～哭成这样，连话都说不出来吗……\n这下麻烦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "e63e27cba5c49cd664dce09c8cea0984cb3d76bfcd314edb8c7213a68c041b1f", "ja": "{$P$}。\nあたしに、まかせてみてくれんかなぁ？", "zh": "{$P$}。\n要不要交给我试试看呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1018_p", "source_sha256": "0b649a8d20e0dfd5a0028f56b6914e0d2851c156185a3aa96d2854cf3dbaf9e3", "ja": "ひなたに？\nいいけど、どうするつもりだ？", "zh": "交给日向？\n可以是可以，但你打算怎么做？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1019_035hin", "source_sha256": "f291fbf1b3553b89d364bcd9a1dc53b6da5a6cfaab67dc68d75c5c08db1396a9", "ja": "ボク、どうして泣いてるんだろか？\nお姉ちゃんに、話してみてくれんかなぁ？", "zh": "我怎么会哭呢？\n能不能跟姐姐说说看呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1020_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "8a55667e9e9b7c3888dfc75f35789092474c1aa27212f22a5ad6913cb0bb146c", "ja": "今日……お母さんが、来れなくなって……。\nボク、ひとりになっちゃって……うぅ……。", "zh": "今天……妈妈来不了了……\n我、变成一个人了……呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1021_035hin", "source_sha256": "971eed4adf34962c1ce23cc56cd8aa358d32a20a81452c9e11927ddaba366fb5", "ja": "そうなんだ。ひとりでお仕事なんて、えらかったねぇ。\nよしよし、大丈夫だよぉ。", "zh": "这样啊。一个人来工作，真是了不起呢。\n乖乖，没事了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1023_p", "source_sha256": "a8cab06ab17a15e5c96ba4307459c7bc1bc15bca76c0b86680476be62a5035a3", "ja": "（ひなたになぐさめられた男の子は、\nすっかり落ち着きを取り戻し……）", "zh": "（被日向安慰的男孩子，已经完全恢复了平静……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1024_035hin", "source_sha256": "035cc0eaf7157da74b5368ff7102067188b75d134fe13d53d586bc24b46e7bb8", "ja": "マネージャーさん、すぐに迎えにくるって。\nよかったねえ。", "zh": "经纪人说马上就会来接你。\n太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1025_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "46046f5d23f066b7db3a212fc08b51847144bd85ae64508396d9e9a66adca2d9", "ja": "うん……ありがとう、お姉ちゃん。ボク、\nもう平気だよ！　お母さんがいなくてもがんばる！", "zh": "嗯……谢谢你，姐姐。\n我已经没事了！就算妈妈不在，我也会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1026_035hin", "source_sha256": "61e136156f58f7447b71c5fc34a4f9333856d766ef777f62c6fcd65de7fadc4d", "ja": "わぁ、強いねえ。こんなに小さいのに\nがんばってて、めんこいねえ。", "zh": "哇，真坚强啊。明明这么小，却一直在努力，真可爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1027_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "b9544af4628c8caff119ff93113191b4fcd651b020448362c287b39dba61ec3f", "ja": "えへへ……あっ、マネージャーさんが来た！\nじゃあね、お姉ちゃん！", "zh": "嘿嘿……啊，经理来了！\n那先这样啦，姐姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1028_se", "source_sha256": "005bab2eac269d4ddf21b28a93f2138c32f32e087b1bcf6ecc745a5fcd22d510", "ja": "タッタッタッタ", "zh": "哒哒哒哒", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1029_035hin", "source_sha256": "f2f9bcdc35092c656bd07de87924988ae400163b8b80b507ad5b6eb4f032c932", "ja": "マネージャーさんが見つかってよかったねぇ、\n{$P$}。あの子も泣き止んだし……。", "zh": "能找到经纪人真是太好了呢，{$P$}。那孩子也不哭了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1030_p", "source_sha256": "fb48540b4e29fdccfd79a14fad7aebf17768f99ff6a2ef1d532e8bfa3ad6447f", "ja": "ああ。けど、ひなたはすごいな……。\nなんというか、しっかりしてる。", "zh": "嗯。不过，雏田真厉害啊……该怎么说呢，真是很可靠。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1031_035hin", "source_sha256": "f6b83c18056aadba326efae06e65160f7130117b01e29293ab4f6ce67f94a94c", "ja": "なんも、なんも。\nあたしはただ、弟の世話で慣れてただけだべさ。", "zh": "没什么，没什么。俺只是照顾弟弟照顾惯了而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1032_035hin", "source_sha256": "7858ad14fa5c1238065a36630bf8694e00600df9ffa84417f3fc16bc90036277", "ja": "それに、しっかりしてるのは、あの子のほうだわ。\nひとりでがんばるって、決めたんだもんねぇ。", "zh": "而且，真正懂事的是那孩子吧。\n她已经决定要独自努力了嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1033_035hin", "source_sha256": "b2f5853249c9ee4d5b7b9821363bca97c7590c48a58b78541eb27d04aa594b6d", "ja": "あたしだったら、あの子ぐらいの年にひとりで\n仕事なんて、きっとおっかなくてできなかったべさ。", "zh": "要是我的话，在那孩子那么大的时候，肯定会害怕得不敢一个人工作吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1034_035hin", "source_sha256": "251a88164da85c9dc48b8e0dbe36edc31e431cc76c655610f73bf327e38e8a98", "ja": "今だって、ちょっこしさみしくって、\n田舎が恋しくなったりするんだもの……。", "zh": "就算是现在，也还是会有点寂寞，偶尔会想念家乡……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1035_p", "source_sha256": "9396f8fffbbd220a8d9d04be01c4150e10d71332a45c6ab40b4dfd1bcac9ffb9", "ja": "ひなた……。", "zh": "日向……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1036_035hin", "source_sha256": "50ee604f4325fc80fbe7a3c407c198efcb466bc1c9d4fce1b327d4ba742fc3fd", "ja": "でも、あの子もがんばるって言ってたから。\nあたしも、がんばらねばなぁ！", "zh": "不过，那孩子也说了自己会努力。\n我也得加油才行呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1037_p", "source_sha256": "bd8137181b509f23d637cd83b6a6cd42a412ad758d3c522f49c9fc3de78e3f72", "ja": "（その後、ひなたと挨拶に行った番組プロデューサーが\nあの子と知り合いだったらしく、とても感謝された）", "zh": "（之后，和日向一起去打招呼的节目制作人似乎认识那个女孩，我们受到了对方的热烈感谢）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_005_1038_p", "source_sha256": "077309b8bd5d6df408e79700d21253a7a3d04da2261cc9d3d45cedc70df19eaf", "ja": "（偶然の出来事だったが、ひなたのいいところを\nアピールする、最高の機会になったようだ！）", "zh": "虽然是偶然发生的事，但似乎成了宣传日向优点的绝佳机会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
